```

**`artifacts/courtbook/src/pages/messages.tsx`** (modified)
- Added `React` import (for `React.ComponentType` in CTX_ICONS type)
- Added icon imports: `Users as UsersIcon, MapPin, Building2, Trophy, CalendarDays`
- Added `useCtxLabel` hook and `CTX_ICONS` map for context card
