  socket.off("new_message", onNewMessage);
  socket.emit("leave_rooms", { dmUserId: otherUserId });
};
```

**`artifacts/courtbook/src/pages/owner-messages.tsx`** (NEW FILE created)
- Global owner inbox page (no per-facility filtering)
